OL,3,GNEWSAConvicted murderer recorded
OL,4,Ahimself planning to kidnap a teenager
OL,5,
OL,6,FA convicted murderer has received a
OL,7,Fsecond life jail term for the
OL,8,Fknifepoint kidnap in broad daylight of
OL,9,Fa 15-year-old girl who he went on to
OL,10,Fsexually assault.
OL,12,FPaul Sharpe, 56, bundled his teenage
OL,13,Fvictim into a car in Altrincham,
OL,14,FGreater Manchester, on 18 May.
OL,16,FManchester Minshull Street Crown Court
OL,17,Fheard Sharpe - jailed in 2001 for
OL,18,Fmurdering an ex-partner - had been to
OL,19,Fthe area months before and had recorded
OL,20,Fvoice memos detailing his planned
OL,21,F"abduction point".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
