OL,4,Ahimself planning to kidnap a teenager
OL,5,
OL,6,FSharpe, from Portswood, Stockport, was
OL,7,Fordered to serve a minimum of eight
OL,8,Fyears in jail before he can be
OL,9,Fconsidered for release by the Parole
OL,10,FBoard.
